sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (Browser)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS Edge
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant API as Backend API (FastAPI)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Ollama as Ollama<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MC as RHOAI Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,HF: Flow 1: Recommendation Workflow
        User->>Route: HTTPS/443 — Chat message<br/>(deployment requirements)
        Route->>UI: HTTP/8501 — TLS terminated
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>HTTP/8000
        API->>Ollama: POST /api/generate<br/>HTTP/11434 — No auth
        Ollama-->>API: Structured DeploymentIntent JSON
        API->>API: Map intent → traffic profile + SLO targets
        API->>PG: SELECT benchmarks<br/>TCP/5432 — Password auth
        PG-->>API: Matching benchmark configs
        API->>HF: GET /api/models/{model}<br/>HTTPS/443 — Bearer (optional)
        HF-->>API: Model config + safetensors metadata
        API->>API: Score configs (accuracy, price,<br/>latency, complexity) → 5 ranked lists
        API-->>UI: Ranked recommendations JSON
        UI-->>Route: Rendered recommendation cards
        Route-->>User: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,K8s: Flow 2: Kubernetes Deployment
        User->>Route: HTTPS/443 — Deploy selected config
        Route->>UI: HTTP/8501
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/deploy-to-cluster<br/>HTTP/8000
        API->>API: Jinja2 template → KServe YAML<br/>(InferenceService + HPA + ServiceMonitor)
        API->>K8s: kubectl apply -f<br/>HTTPS/6443 — kubeconfig/SA token
        K8s-->>API: InferenceService created
        API-->>UI: Deployment status + YAML
        UI-->>Route: Deployment confirmation
        Route-->>User: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 230)
        Note over API,MC: Flow 3: Model Catalog Sync (RHOAI)
        API->>MC: GET /api/benchmarks<br/>HTTPS/8443 — Bearer/SA token<br/>TLS 1.2+ (custom CA)
        MC-->>API: Benchmark data JSON
        API->>PG: INSERT/UPDATE benchmarks<br/>TCP/5432 — Password auth
        PG-->>API: Rows affected
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over User,HF: Flow 4: Capacity Planning
        User->>Route: HTTPS/443 — Model + GPU query
        Route->>UI: HTTP/8501
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/calculate<br/>HTTP/8000
        API->>HF: GET model config<br/>HTTPS/443 — Bearer (optional)
        HF-->>API: Architecture params (heads, layers, etc.)
        API->>API: Calculate GPU memory:<br/>weights + KV cache + activations + CUDA graphs
        API-->>UI: Memory breakdown JSON
        UI-->>Route: Capacity analysis view
        Route-->>User: HTTPS response
    end
